{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51164","headline":"座右铭（《陈伯玉集》未收） · 陈子昂","name":"座右铭（《陈伯玉集》未收）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"事父尽孝敬，事君端忠贞。\n兄弟敦和睦，朋友笃信诚。\n从官重公慎，立身贵廉明。\n待士慕谦让，莅民尚宽平。\n理讼惟正直，察狱必审情。\n谤议不足怨，宠辱讵须惊？\n处[满]（蒲）常惮溢，居高本虑倾。\n诗、礼固可学，郑、卫不足听。\n幸能修实操，何俟钧虚声？\n白珪玷可灭，黄金诺不轻。\n秦穆饮盗马，楚客报绝缨。\n言行既无择，存殁自扬名。\n（《文苑英华》七九○《铭》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}